<div class="row">
  <%= render partial: "shared/breadcrumb" %>
</div>
<div class="row mb-4">
  <article class="card col-6 offset-3">
    <header>
      <h3>About this Project</h3>
      <p class="text-light">For a free 20 dollar car wash of course</p>
      <p></p>
    </header>
    <div class="px-6">
      <p>The ultimate goal of this project is to save users money without investing the time and mental load into tracking sporting events.</p>
      <p>Absolutely <i>no</i> gambling promotions will be covered since they are the antithesis of this project. If you or a loved one needs <%= link_to "help", "https://www.1800gambler.net/help", target: :_blank, class: "underline" %>.</p>
      <p>As the developer of this site, I have been writing some about the journey of this project on my <%= link_to "blog/portfolio", "https://kalmai.github.io/portfolio/", target: :_blank, class: "underline" %> and will likely continue chronicling the adventure.</p>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight">Yeah, but why?</h3>
      <p>My father often took advantage of these game-day-promotions, I wanted to as well but do not care about sports, my car has needed a car wash for years, through this project I can actualize a free car wash (around a $20 value), learn something, and maybe help others.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
<%= render partial: "shared/footer" %>
